            "status": "return",
            "payload": {
              "readable": "{\"evidence_quote\":\"Surrender is the second studio album by American indie pop singer-songwriter Maggie Rogers, released on July 29, 2022, by Debay Sounds and Capitol Records. It follows the release of her debut studio album, Heard It in a Past Life (2019).\"\"option\":null\"reason\":\"Evidence confirms 'Surrender' was released on July 29, 2022. Per Billboard's standard tracking, a Friday release (July 29) debuts on the chart dated the Saturday 15 days later (August 13, 2022). The proposed June 4 date is incorrect, and the correct date is not provided among the available amendment options.\"\"release_digest\":\"489644952f51cabeb2c40c5f64116794f3dc414caf17dcce83b60421da46f0a6\"\"release_url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Surrender_%28Maggie_Rogers_album%29&oldid=1308571311\"\"rule_quote\":\"The Billboard 200 chart ranks the most popular albums of the week in the U.S. based on multi-metric consumption as measured in equivalent album units. Units are comprised of traditional album sales, track equivalent albums (TEA) and streaming equivalent albums (SEA). The new Sept. 7-dated chart (where Lover enters at No. 1) will be posted in full on Billboard's websites on Wednesday, Sept. 4 (one day later than usual, due to the Labor Day holiday in the U.S. on Sept. 2).\"\"rules_digest\":\"73b700456c70d804fcc35ebe7cc987c47113eef0673f4c88ce9180c9437448af\"\"rules_url\":\"https://web.archive.org/web/20211010140829id_/https://www.billboard.com/articles/business/chart-beat/8528870/taylor-swift-lover-album-debuts-at-no-1-on-billboard-200-chart/\"\"status\":\"ruled\"\"verdict\":\"VOIDED\"}"
